      "text": "[curious] Do you like buying shoes? How often do you buy them?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.16,
      "end": 3.06
    },
    {
      "text": "[relaxed] Not really. I don't really have the habit of buying shoes, because my family isn't actually that rich. I usually just wear a pair until they don't feel good to wear anymore, like after a year or two, when the leather gets a bit worn out. I mean, it's not like they're falling apart or anything, but once they start to look a little worn, I'll switch to a new pair. [uncertain] So, I'd say I buy a new pair of shoes maybe every two or three years.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 3.36,
      "end": 25.78
    }
  ],
